00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.520
Your dad and I spent 15 years together on the LAPD,

00:00:37.535 --> 00:00:41.009
and he always told me his dream
was for you to go to college.

00:00:41.009 --> 00:00:43.000
SAT prep course? Dude, I'm 12.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:49.200
Turn to page six you lil bitch, and if I
hear that you haven't been studying,

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.860
I'm gonna come see you myself, you understand?

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:54.120
