00:00:57.151 --> 00:00:59.189
No, she was abducted by aliens.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:01.020
Sweetie?

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:02.846
Okay, I know what you're thinking.

00:01:02.846 --> 00:01:03.899
It's crazy, actually I was-

