Who the hell are you?

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:10.600
Why did you take us?

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:11.840
I'm Barry.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:16.960
I'm your kidnapper and unfortunately,
that's all I can say about that.

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:20.195
That's not very fair is it?

00:01:20.195 --> 00:01:21.778
I work for The Bureau Underground.

00:01:21.778 --> 00:01:25.130
We investigate the paranormal and
anything outside the scientific realm.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:26.475
Is this a hidden-camera show?

00:01:26.475 --> 00:01:27.413
Where's Alex Trebek?

00:01:27.413 --> 00:01:29.698
Wait, did Alex Trebek have a hidden-camera show?

00:01:29.698 --> 00:01:30.650
How did I miss that?

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:34.040
I am Captain Lafrey.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:39.780
I am not exaggerating when I say that the
fate of the entire planet may rest in you.

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:40.280
Oh, hang on.

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:43.340
Hey, sweetie. What's up?

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:45.831
I'm sorry. Did she just say the fate of the entire planet?

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.300
She's talking to her daughter.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:49.360
Yeah, she took the call. She's the rude one.

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:52.380
Starting now you two are working for The Underground.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.899
It all leads to Water Bridge nuclear power plant.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:57.600
We need to get you inside that reactor room.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:59.080
Hi, yeah, the printer is jammed.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.160
