00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:03.760
How's it going, Ma'am?

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:06.259
This is one of those. This is a copy machine.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:07.310
Uh-huh.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:10.556
I'm more of a fax machine guy,
Max-the-fax machine guy.

00:02:10.556 --> 00:02:12.267
That has a fax machine in it.

00:02:12.267 --> 00:02:12.767
This one?

00:02:12.767 --> 00:02:14.000
Yep, that one right there.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:14.780
2-in-1.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:17.600
Since this is an all-in-one wraparound,
I think that's more your specialty.

00:02:17.609 --> 00:02:18.469
Maybe you should just go ahead-

00:02:18.469 --> 00:02:20.540
That's enough backtalk, bro!

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:21.120
I'm gonna go.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.640
No! I want you to see this!

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:23.260
Why? She doesn't-

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:25.700
You will show me the respect I've earned!

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:27.300
Yeah, I can't be here for this.

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:30.740
And scene. That was great.

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:31.520
Watch your face.

00:02:33.269 --> 00:02:36.979
You can stay in here cuz you're certifiably
nuts and you might get me killed.

00:02:36.979 --> 00:02:38.979
Woah! Leroy!

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:42.090
I could've died in there!

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:44.580
Aw, someone need a hug?

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.720
Want to go to an independent
coffee house and talk it out?

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:51.320
Something's going on over there. Lift me up.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:52.502
I wanna peep through the vent.

00:02:52.502 --> 00:02:54.280
Or just like maybe redo that the other way around?

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:54.940
Why?

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.860
They have guns and bullets and we are frightened!

00:03:09.866 --> 00:03:12.050
I repeat! We are very very frightened!

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.200
I can't believe you let me come with you.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.640
You begged me, remember?

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:20.900
"Leroy, please, I need this!
Everybody hates me! I'm a loser!"

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:21.920
Why was the head yelling?

00:03:21.921 --> 00:03:23.960
The head should not have been yelling.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.020
It's a good question.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.556
Gentlemen, welcome to The Bureau Underground.

00:03:34.556 --> 00:03:35.056
Congrats, man.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:37.600
Wow.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:39.500
